      "description": {
        "en": "Connect the MT Manager app on your Android phone to DeepSeek Harness. Set the phone's MCP address in the Web settings page; phone file, APK and ZIP capabilities appear as mcp__mt__* tools. The address can be changed any time without restarting DSH.",
